{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"33":"Etiquette"},"section_detail":{"33":{"hadithnumber_first":3657,"hadithnumber_last":3826,"arabicnumber_first":3657,"arabicnumber_last":3826,"name_native":"كتاب الأدب"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3769,"arabicnumber":3769,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر، حدثنا سفيان بن عيينة، عن الزهري، عن سالم، عن ابيه، ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال \" لا تتركوا النار في بيوتكم حين تنامون","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":33,"hadith":113}}]}